This repository imports PyTorch, torchvision, Transformers, timm,
segmentation_models_pytorch and other dependencies. Their implementations
are not vendored into this repository. Segmentation adapters use their
public APIs. The DINO linear decoder and EoMT attention-mask adaptation
follow the upstream published methods. See docs/third-party.md and the
pinned source catalog for attribution, source revisions and access terms.

This release contains no PalmCity dataset, pretrained weight, finetuned
checkpoint, access token or private session log. The author confirmed
pretrained/external-data permission for the reported challenge experiment.
Other users should follow the dataset, upstream model and challenge terms.

The final PalmCity inference weights are published separately at
https://huggingface.co/yunusserhat/palmcity-eomt-dinov3-large under the
DINOv3 License, with the underlying EoMT notice retained. The Hugging Face
model card describes their training and use. These model terms are separate
from the GPL license of this code repository.
